  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the busy restaurant Claude Monet, the fiery Chef commands everyone back to work. Max has just arrived in kitchen whites, eager to prove that he is a professional cook. As always, listen to the story first, and then we will break it down together in English.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Все за работу, быстро!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А ты иди переодевайся!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, я готов. Что мне делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему ты пришёл на эту кухню?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Потому что я повар. Я настоящий профессионал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Профессионал? Иди сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Посмотри вокруг на моих поваров.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что ты сам умеешь делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я очень хорошо умею готовить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да ну? Всем внимание на кухне!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "К нам пришёл великий повар!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мы так долго ждали его!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Какая у меня будет работа?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Для тебя есть особенная работа!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us go through each line together to understand every word.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Все за работу, быстро!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone get to work, quickly!' Chef Barinov snaps everyone out of the spectacle and demands focus.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А ты иди переодевайся!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And you, go get changed!' He brusquely orders the new hire to put on a proper uniform.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, я готов.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, I am ready.' Max returns eagerly in his new white jacket, ready to begin.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Что мне делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What should I do?' He asks for his very first assignment on the line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Почему ты пришёл на эту кухню?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you come to this kitchen?' Chef Barinov questions his underlying motivation for being there.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Потому что я повар.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because I am a cook.' Max confidently states his chosen profession as his driving purpose.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я настоящий профессионал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a true professional.' He proudly boasts about his skills and readiness for high-level culinary work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Профессионал?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A professional?' Chef Barinov echoes the boast with heavy skepticism.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Иди сюда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come here.' He commands the young man to step forward and face the music.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Посмотри вокруг на моих поваров.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look around at my cooks.' Chef Barinov gestures to his busy, experienced team working around them.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Что ты сам умеешь делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What can you do yourself?' He aggressively challenges the newcomer to list his actual abilities.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я очень хорошо умею готовить.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can cook very well.' Max bravely doubles down on his core talent.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Да ну?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really?' Chef Barinov delivers a short, mocking response to this generic claim.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Всем внимание на кухне!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Attention everyone in the kitchen!' He theatrically calls for the entire staff to stop and listen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "К нам пришёл великий повар!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A great cook has come to us!' Chef Barinov sarcastically announces the arrival of a culinary genius.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Мы так долго ждали его!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We waited for him for so long!' He continues to mock the rookie's grand ego in front of everyone.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Какая у меня будет работа?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What work will I have?' Max ignores the teasing and earnestly asks for a task.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Для тебя есть особенная работа!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a special job for you!' Chef Barinov gleefully prepares to hand out a demeaning chore. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
