    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max is confident and eager to cook, but Chef Viktor Barinov has a very different first task in mind. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'fast' and 'to be' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
